.Sh HISTORY
Since OpenSSL 3.5, the
.Sy -digest
option implies
.Sy -rawin ,
and these two options are no longer required when signing or verifying
with an Ed25519 or Ed448 key.
.Pp
Also since OpenSSL 3.5, the
.Sy -kemop
option is no longer required for any of the supported algorithms, the
only supported
.Sy mode
is now the default.
.Pp
The
.Sy -engine
option was deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0.
